- Deterministically title issues with the Stacker News ID: `[radar] SN bounty #${id} [sn-${id}]: ${title} (${bounty} Sats)`.
- Query existing open issues via GitHub API before creating new ones.
- Auto-close issues when Stacker News bounties are paid or expired.

